---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import MediaSlot from '../components/MediaSlot.astro';
---

<Layout title="About" description="Arnab Majumder. Robotics Engineering student at the University of Toronto, Controls & Embedded Systems Engineer at Aston Dynamics.">
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-14">
    <p class="font-mono-tight text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-fg-dim">About</p>
    <div class="contour-rule mt-2"></div>
    <h1 class="mt-4 font-serif text-3xl font-semibold text-fg sm:text-4xl">Arnab Majumder</h1>

    <div class="mt-8 max-w-xs">
      <MediaSlot label="Headshot" src="/media/about/headshot.jpg" aspect="aspect-square" />
    </div>

    <div class="mt-8 space-y-5 text-fg-muted">
      <p>
        I have one year left in Engineering Science (Robotics Engineering) at the University of Toronto, graduating
        in April 2028. I'm taking a gap year to work full-time as a Controls &amp; Embedded Systems Engineer at Aston
        Dynamics, where I write control loops, vehicle simulations and firmware for two products now in customer
        beta. Before the gap year, I worked there full-time while studying full-time. I like engineering where the
        software has to deal with a physical system that pushes back.
      </p>
      <p>
        I like working across disciplines rather than staying in one lane. Modeling a system, writing the
        control logic, building the electronics it runs on, and then testing the whole thing outside a lab is
        more interesting to me than any one piece of that on its own. Before university I captained my FIRST
        Robotics team to its first competition win in 8 years, then mentored it until 2025, teaching CAD and
        electrical design.
      </p>
      <p>
        Outside of engineering, I travel a lot: 26 countries since July 2025. I make short-form content about it as
        <a href="https://www.instagram.com/arnabsalive/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="text-accent hover:underline"> @arnabsalive</a>,
        which gets about a million views a month, and every week students message me about what it's done for them.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-6 max-w-xs">
      <MediaSlot label="Somewhere in the Alps" src="/media/travel/alps-portrait.jpg" aspect="aspect-[4/5]" class="rotate-[-1deg]" />
    </div>

    <div class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
      <a href="/resume" class="border border-border-strong px-5 py-2.5 font-mono-tight text-sm uppercase tracking-wider text-fg transition-colors hover:border-accent hover:text-accent">
        Resume
      </a>
      <a href="/contact" class="border border-border-strong px-5 py-2.5 font-mono-tight text-sm uppercase tracking-wider text-fg transition-colors hover:border-accent hover:text-accent">
        Contact
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
